{"content": "<!-- awi-geo-start -->\n<h2>Berapa harga BYD Atto 3 di Makassar?</h2>\n<p>Harga OTR BYD Atto 3 di Makassar Rp435.000.000. BYD Atto 3 adalah SUV listrik kompak dengan kabin modern, tersedia dalam 1 tipe, dan dijual resmi oleh BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar, dealer resmi BYD dan Denza di Jl. Ahmad Yani No. 15, Makassar, Sulawesi Selatan. Semua harga di bawah adalah harga on the road (OTR) Makassar. Stok terbatas, harga terbaik bulan ini.</p>\n<h2>Tipe dan harga OTR BYD Atto 3 Makassar</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>BYD Atto 3 Advanced Plus</strong>: Rp435.000.000 OTR Makassar</li></ul>\n<h2>Test drive dan simulasi kredit BYD Atto 3 di Makassar</h2>\n<p>Showroom BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar buka Senin sampai Sabtu pukul 08.00 sampai 17.00 WITA dan Minggu pukul 09.00 sampai 17.00 WITA. Untuk jadwal test drive, simulasi kredit, atau cek stok BYD Atto 3, hubungi Sales Consultant AWI lewat <a href=\"https://wa.me/6282259452349?text=Halo%20Kak%20AWI%2C%20saya%20mau%20tanya%20harga%20OTR%20dan%20test%20drive%20BYD%20Atto%203%20di%20Makassar.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp 0822-5945-2349</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Bandingkan harga model BYD lain di Makassar:</strong> <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-atto-1/\">Harga BYD Atto 1 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-dolphin/\">Harga BYD Dolphin Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-m6/\">Harga BYD M6 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-m6-dm/\">Harga BYD M6 DM Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-seal/\">Harga BYD Seal Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-sealion-7/\">Harga BYD Sealion 7 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-denza-d9/\">Harga Denza D9 Makassar</a>. Lihat juga <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/harga-byd-makassar/\">daftar harga semua mobil BYD Makassar 2026</a>.</p>\n<!-- awi-geo-end -->\n\n<p style=\"margin:30px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">BYD Atto 3</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;color:#111111\">Elevate Versatility: SUV Listrik Serbaguna untuk Keluarga di Makassar</h2><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-makassar-hero.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 3 SUV listrik warna Atlantis Gray di dealer resmi BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1017\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 14px\" /><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\"><a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-atto-3/\"><strong>BYD Atto 3</strong></a> adalah SUV listrik 5 penumpang yang dibangun di atas e-Platform 3.0 dengan BYD Blade Battery 49,92 kWh. Jarak tempuhnya hingga 410 km (NEDC), tenaganya 150 kW dengan torsi 310 Nm, dan akselerasi 0–100 km/jam 7,9 detik.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Ground clearance 175 mm, bagasi hingga 1.340 L, panoramic sunroof, dan electric tailgate membuat Atto 3 nyaman dipakai harian di Makassar maupun perjalanan keluarga ke luar kota. Harga OTR Makassar untuk tipe Advanced Plus <strong>Rp435.000.000</strong>. Stok terbatas, harga terbaik bulan ini.</p><a href=\"https://wa.me/6282259452349?text=Halo%20Kak%20AWI%2C%20saya%20lihat%20halaman%20BYD%20Atto%203%20di%20website%20BYD%20Makassar.%20Mau%20tanya%20harga%20OTR%20dan%20jadwal%20test%20drive.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;margin:0 10px 10px 0\">Chat AWI untuk Test Drive Atto 3</a><a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/simulasi-kredit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#111111;color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;margin:0 10px 10px 0\">Simulasi Kredit</a>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Desain Eksterior</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Tampil Modern dari Segala Sisi</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Garis bodi SUV yang tegas dengan lampu LED tipis menyatu di depan dan velg alloy 18 inci yang sporty.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-tampak-depan.webp\" alt=\"Tampak depan BYD Atto 3\" width=\"1396\" height=\"806\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 14px\" />\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-tampak-samping.webp\" alt=\"Tampak samping BYD Atto 3\" width=\"1400\" height=\"617\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 14px\" />\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-lampu-led.webp\" alt=\"Lampu LED depan BYD Atto 3\" width=\"1039\" height=\"268\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>LED Light.</strong> Lampu depan LED dengan Adaptive Front Light, Follow Me Home, dan DRL LED.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-velg-18-inci.webp\" alt=\"Velg alloy 18 inci BYD Atto 3\" width=\"941\" height=\"699\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Velg alloy 18 inci</strong> dengan ban 235/50 R18.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Teknologi</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">e-Platform 3.0 dan BYD Blade Battery</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Fondasi mobil listrik generasi terbaru dari BYD. e-Platform 3.0 dirancang khusus untuk mobil listrik, sehingga lantai kabin rata, bodi lebih kaku, dan efisiensinya tinggi. Blade Battery dikenal dengan standar keamanan tinggi dan umur pakai panjang.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-e-platform-3.webp\" alt=\"e-Platform 3.0 BYD Atto 3\" width=\"769\" height=\"433\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>e-Platform 3.0</strong>, platform khusus mobil listrik dari BYD.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-blade-battery.webp\" alt=\"BYD Blade Battery pada BYD Atto 3\" width=\"928\" height=\"522\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>BYD Blade Battery 49,92 kWh</strong> dengan jarak tempuh hingga 410 km (NEDC).</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:6px 0 18px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Jarak tempuh NEDC</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">410<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> km</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Tenaga maksimum</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">150<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> kW</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Pengisian DC</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">70<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> kW</span></div></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Atto 3 bisa dicas di rumah dengan kabel portabel bawaan atau di SPKLU dengan port DC CCS2 hingga 70 kW. Fitur <strong>V2L</strong> lengkap dengan adaptornya bisa dipakai untuk menyalakan peralatan listrik, misalnya saat piknik atau ketika listrik di rumah padam. Hitung penghematannya di <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/kalkulator-hemat/\">Kalkulator Hemat BBM vs Listrik</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Kepraktisan</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Lega untuk Barang, Lapang untuk Penumpang</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-electric-tailgate.webp\" alt=\"Electric tailgate BYD Atto 3\" width=\"628\" height=\"523\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Electric tailgate</strong> yang bisa dibuka dan ditutup dengan satu sentuhan. Bagasi 440 L, bisa diperluas hingga 1.340 L dengan kursi belakang dilipat 60/40.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-panoramic-sunroof.webp\" alt=\"Panoramic sunroof BYD Atto 3\" width=\"1400\" height=\"902\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Panoramic sunroof</strong> elektrik dengan fitur anti-jepit, membuat kabin terasa lebih terang dan lapang.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Interior</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Sleek Black Interior Design</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Kabin bernuansa hitam dengan aksen biru-abu, ambient light multi-warna, dan layar sentuh 15,6 inci sebagai pusat kendali.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-interior-hitam.webp\" alt=\"Interior Sleek Black BYD Atto 3 dengan layar 15,6 inci\" width=\"772\" height=\"439\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 14px\" />\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 20px;padding:0;line-height:1.8;color:#333\"><li>Layar sentuh 15,6 inci dan panel instrumen digital 5 inci</li><li>Apple CarPlay dan Android Auto <strong>wireless</strong>, 6 speaker, dan voice assistant</li><li>Wireless phone charger serta port USB-A dan USB-C di depan maupun belakang</li><li>Keyless entry, Card Key, Bluetooth Key, dan BYD Digital Key di HP</li><li>Jok pengemudi elektrik 6 arah dan penumpang depan elektrik 4 arah</li><li>AC otomatis dengan filter CN95 dan PM2.5 untuk udara kabin yang lebih bersih</li></ul>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Keselamatan</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Aman untuk Seluruh Keluarga</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 20px;padding:0;line-height:1.8;color:#333\"><li><strong>7 airbag:</strong> depan, samping depan, tirai depan dan belakang, serta far-side airbag pengemudi</li><li><strong>Kamera 360°</strong>, 2 radar depan, dan 4 radar belakang</li><li><strong>ADAS:</strong> Stop &amp; Go Full Speed Adaptive Cruise Control, Automatic Emergency Braking, Door Open Warning, Lane Departure Warning, Lane Keeping Assist, Rear Cross Traffic Alert &amp; Brake</li><li>Auto Hold, rem parkir elektrik, ABS, ESC, TCS, EBD, Hill Descent Control, dan TPMS</li><li>ISOFIX di kursi belakang sisi luar</li></ul>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Pilihan Warna</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Exterior Colors Option</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">4 pilihan warna eksterior, termasuk warna baru <strong>Atlantis Gray</strong>. Interior berwarna (Blue + Grey)/Black.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-cosmos-black.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 3 warna Cosmos Black\" width=\"944\" height=\"545\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Cosmos Black</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-ski-white.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 3 warna Ski White\" width=\"944\" height=\"545\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Ski White</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-harbour-gray.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 3 warna Harbour Gray\" width=\"944\" height=\"545\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Harbour Gray</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-3-atlantis-gray.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 3 warna baru Atlantis Gray\" width=\"941\" height=\"543\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\">Atlantis Gray <strong>(warna baru)</strong></figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Spesifikasi</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Spesifikasi Lengkap BYD Atto 3 Advanced Plus</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 10px\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;background:#fff\"><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Dimensi</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Panjang x Lebar x Tinggi</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>4.455 x 1.875 x 1.615 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jarak sumbu roda</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>2.720 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jarak pijak depan / belakang</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>1.575 / 1.580 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Ground clearance</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>175 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Kapasitas bagasi</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>440 L (maks. 1.340 L)</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Berat kosong / GVM</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>1.680 kg / 2.090 kg</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Kapasitas penumpang</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>5 orang</strong></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Motor &amp; Performa</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Motor</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Permanent Magnet Synchronous Motor</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Tenaga maksimum</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>150 kW</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Torsi maksimum</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>310 Nm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Akselerasi 0–100 km/jam</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>7,9 detik</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Kecepatan maksimum</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>160 km/jam</strong></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Baterai &amp; Pengisian Daya</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jenis baterai</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>BYD Blade Battery</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Kapasitas baterai</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>49,92 kWh</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jarak tempuh (NEDC)</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>410 km</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Port pengisian DC</td><td style=\"padding:9px